

Welcome as a new user to this BBS! In that this is the first time you have
used this system I would like you to provide me with some basic information
about yourself (if you would rather not, then just hang up, I won't mind, but
you will not be allowed access here until you fill out all the answers to
these questions).

----------------------------  IMPORTANT  ---------------------------------
  Any time you need HELP type a question mark and press the Enter key.
  Any time you see the text '--more--' just press the Enter key when you
                         are ready to continue.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Any time you feel like quitting, just hang up the phone; on the other hand
if you want to register then you have to provide an answer to each question
(e.g. if you have no work telephone number then enter '-' rather than just
pressing enter without writing anything). The password you provide me with
now will be needed every time you log onto the system (just to make sure
that YOU are YOU!) so please don't forget it (I recommend that you choose
something that is not too obvious, preferably a random string of letters
and numbers).

The password is CASE-sensitive!

